[{"client_msg_id":"74fea3c2-82b1-4187-9af1-7d407ceb3cf5","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"いけました！ありがとうございます:pray:\n```command! PackInstall call s:init() | call PackInit() | call minpac#update('') | call minpac#status() | qa```\nこれで\n```vim -c :PackInstall```\nでプラグインがインストールできるようになりました。","ts":"1615482269.029200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tada","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UL6CFN8NR","UFP0GQZ4K"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l3JW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73d563d2-e02c-4300-9d8b-6eee2906ded3","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"試してみます！","ts":"1615481671.027900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0ISUb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d98e1864-5d12-4018-825d-561baa5e95d9","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"minpac#status()でも挟んでおけばブロッキングしてくれたはず","ts":"1615481646.027700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pOR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad622f53-c914-46e7-b0e8-2d9180448c64","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"minpac を使ってるんですが、以下のようなユーザー定義コマンドを実行したときにminpac#updateの完了を待つにはどう書けばいいでしょうか？\nすぐVimが終了してしまうんですよね\n```command! PackInstall call s:init() | call PackInit() | call minpac#update('', {'do': 'echom installed'}) | q```","ts":"1615481606.026800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gF1Hf"}]}]
